    "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\"><strong>·9月更新内容前瞻</strong></span></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"305\" title=\"9月前瞻.png\" alt=\"9月前瞻.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20250910/9626bb8209bb992a382dad48125ea232.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">·游览者列表</span></strong></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"306\" title=\"9月小队.png\" alt=\"9月小队.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20250910/c29ae52b8a6697ff793187c16e3c0d0a.png\"/></div><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">界园游客 夕</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">以画为镜，可识天地、观人心。然镜有碎时，画有破日，画中之人，又将何往？</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">·游园纪念</span></strong></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"307\" title=\"9月奖励.png\" alt=\"9月奖励.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20250910/d525056caa1909460f8480c427947cb8.png\"/></div><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">游园纪念添加内容</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">游园纪念的等级上限提升至</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">80</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span></span></p><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">9月稀有奖励 界面主题 悬想</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">心中一点烟霞在，染去天地俱是红。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">·本月委托栏</span></strong></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">本月委托栏将会覆盖一批委托。委托更新后，上月的委托进度将不会被继承。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">您将获得可在本月使用的四次刷新未完成委托的机会。点击刷新后，即可重新获得同等级的委托。</span></span></span></p>",
